{"3531950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Halloween VR", "steam_appid": 3531950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween themed semi open world Monster Shooter Game</strong> with a Medieval Setting. You play as a Monster Hunter sent to cleans a Medieval World from all things that go bump in the night. Clear out monsters in different areas, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Play minigames to unlock new weapons. Collect loot drops to increase your abilities in battle. Combat varies from slow to intense depending on the area of the map. There is no story, no cutscenes just shoot 'em up chaos and good fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities: </strong>Speed Boost - Invincibility Shield - Time Dilation<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up ability loot drops to enhance your combat abilities. Speed boost increases your max run speed for a limited time. Shield protects you from damage for a limited time. Use Time Dilation to slow time which also gives you the ability to steal fallen enemy weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons: </strong>Pistol, Shotgun, Rifle, Sword, Bow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> Pumpkin Spider - Freddy Pumpkin - Mutants - Zombie - Vampires - Skeletons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses: Mushroom Monster - Mutant - Reaper - Spyder Queen - Ancient One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween themed semi open world Monster Shooter Game</strong> with a Medieval Setting. You play as a Monster Hunter sent to cleans a Medieval World from all things that go bump in the night. Clear out monsters in different areas, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Play minigames to unlock new weapons. Collect loot drops to increase your abilities in battle. Combat varies from slow to intense depending on the area of the map. There is no story, no cutscenes just shoot 'em up chaos and good fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities: </strong>Speed Boost - Invincibility Shield - Time Dilation<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up ability loot drops to enhance your combat abilities. Speed boost increases your max run speed for a limited time. Shield protects you from damage for a limited time. Use Time Dilation to slow time which also gives you the ability to steal fallen enemy weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons: </strong>Pistol, Shotgun, Rifle, Sword, Bow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> Pumpkin Spider - Freddy Pumpkin - Mutants - Zombie - Vampires - Skeletons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses: Mushroom Monster - Mutant - Reaper - Spyder Queen - Ancient One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Halloween themed semi open world Monster Shooter Game with a Medieval Setting. Clear out enemies, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Simple shoot 'em up chaos and good fun.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/6ff4606bbbfa9a048ff483c6494c975c544ab3ba/header.jpg?t=1779461985", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/49f9d8239693a5ae38e2830209a671d96034aabb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779461985", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/49f9d8239693a5ae38e2830209a671d96034aabb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779461985", "website": "http://www